{"seq":3,"slug":"muscle-adaptation-and-hypertrophy","title":"肌肉适应与肥大","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/muscle-physiology/muscle-adaptation-and-hypertrophy","wordCount":2663,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"肌肉适应与肥大\">肌肉适应与肥大</h1><p>骨骼肌具有卓越的表型可塑性，能够根据施加的力学刺激和代谢需求进行结构和功能重塑。肌肉肥大（hypertrophy）是抗阻训练最显著的适应性反应之一，涉及复杂的机械信号转导、蛋白质合成调控和卫星细胞生物学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>肥大类型</strong>：肌原纤维肥大（收缩蛋白增加，驱动力量）与肌浆肥大（非收缩成分增加，关联耐力与泵感）；并联肥大增粗纤维、串联肥大延长纤维。</li>\n<li><strong>信号枢纽</strong>：mTORC1 是蛋白合成的核心调控节点，机械张力、IGF-1 与亮氨酸经不同通路汇聚激活它；Akt 同时抑制 FoxO，实现促合成与抑分解的双向调节。</li>\n<li><strong>净平衡</strong>：肌肉体积取决于蛋白合成（MPS）与降解（MPB）的净差额，泛素-蛋白酶体与自噬系统主管降解。</li>\n<li><strong>肌核域</strong>：每个肌核管辖有限胞浆体积，持续肥大需卫星细胞增殖并融合以增加肌核数量，并构成&quot;肌肉记忆&quot;的基础。</li>\n<li><strong>驱动力排序</strong>：机械张力是肥大的主要驱动力，代谢应激与肌肉损伤为辅助刺激，&quot;渐进超负荷&quot;是长期进步的必要条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"肌肉肥大的类型\">肌肉肥大的类型</h2><h3 id=\"肌原纤维肥大与肌浆肥大\">肌原纤维肥大与肌浆肥大</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[肌肉肥大] --&gt; B[肌原纤维肥大&lt;br/&gt;Myofibrillar Hypertrophy]&#10;    A --&gt; C[肌浆肥大&lt;br/&gt;Sarcoplasmic Hypertrophy]&#10;    B --&gt; D[收缩蛋白增加&lt;br/&gt;力量增长]&#10;    B --&gt; E[肌原纤维数量和面积增大]&#10;    C --&gt; F[非收缩蛋白/糖原/水分增加]&#10;    C --&gt; G[肌浆网/线粒体/酶增加]&#10;    A --&gt; H[结缔组织增生&lt;br/&gt;肌外膜/肌内膜增厚]\">graph TD\n    A[肌肉肥大] --&gt; B[肌原纤维肥大&lt;br/&gt;Myofibrillar Hypertrophy]\n    A --&gt; C[肌浆肥大&lt;br/&gt;Sarcoplasmic Hypertrophy]\n    B --&gt; D[收缩蛋白增加&lt;br/&gt;力量增长]\n    B --&gt; E[肌原纤维数量和面积增大]\n    C --&gt; F[非收缩蛋白/糖原/水分增加]\n    C --&gt; G[肌浆网/线粒体/酶增加]\n    A --&gt; H[结缔组织增生&lt;br/&gt;肌外膜/肌内膜增厚]</pre><p><strong>肌原纤维肥大</strong>：收缩蛋白（肌球蛋白和肌动蛋白）含量增加，肌原纤维的横截面积和数量（纵裂增殖）增大。与力量和功率输出的增加直接相关。主要由高机械张力训练驱动。</p>\n<p><strong>肌浆肥大</strong>：非收缩成分增加，包括肌浆网体积、糖原储量（可增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\% \\sim 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span>）、胞浆水分和代谢酶。与肌肉耐力和&quot;泵感&quot;相关。主要由代谢应激训练（高容量、短间歇）驱动。</p>\n<p>两种肥大在实际训练中同时发生，比例取决于训练方式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"串联肥大与并联肥大\">串联肥大与并联肥大</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>并联肥大（Parallel Hypertrophy）</strong>：肌原纤维并排增加，肌纤维横截面积增大，产力能力增强</li>\n<li><strong>串联肥大（Series Hypertrophy）</strong>：肌节沿纤维长轴方向增加，纤维长度增长，最大缩短速度增加</li>\n</ul>\n<p>串联肥大主要见于离心训练适应和关节固定在拉长位时的重塑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"肥大的信号转导通路\">肥大的信号转导通路</h2><h3 id=\"mtor通路-蛋白合成的核心调控枢纽\">mTOR通路——蛋白合成的核心调控枢纽</h3><p>哺乳动物雷帕霉素靶蛋白复合物1（mTORC1）是调控肌肉蛋白合成（MPS）的关键激酶复合物。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[机械张力] --&gt; B[磷脂酶D / PA]&#10;    C[生长因子 IGF-1/MGF] --&gt; D[PI3K → Akt]&#10;    E[氨基酸 亮氨酸] --&gt; F[Rag GTPases → mTORC1定位]&#10;    B --&gt; G[mTORC1激活]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[p70S6K磷酸化]&#10;    G --&gt; I[4E-BP1磷酸化]&#10;    H --&gt; J[核糖体生物发生&lt;br/&gt;翻译效率增加]&#10;    I --&gt; K[帽依赖翻译起始]&#10;    J --&gt; L[肌肉蛋白合成 MPS 增加]&#10;    K --&gt; L&#10;    M[AMPK 能量缺乏] --&gt;|抑制| G&#10;    N[Myostatin] --&gt;|Smad2/3| O[抑制Akt]&#10;    O --&gt;|抑制| G\">flowchart TD\n    A[机械张力] --&gt; B[磷脂酶D / PA]\n    C[生长因子 IGF-1/MGF] --&gt; D[PI3K → Akt]\n    E[氨基酸 亮氨酸] --&gt; F[Rag GTPases → mTORC1定位]\n    B --&gt; G[mTORC1激活]\n    D --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[p70S6K磷酸化]\n    G --&gt; I[4E-BP1磷酸化]\n    H --&gt; J[核糖体生物发生&lt;br/&gt;翻译效率增加]\n    I --&gt; K[帽依赖翻译起始]\n    J --&gt; L[肌肉蛋白合成 MPS 增加]\n    K --&gt; L\n    M[AMPK 能量缺乏] --&gt;|抑制| G\n    N[Myostatin] --&gt;|Smad2/3| O[抑制Akt]\n    O --&gt;|抑制| G</pre><h3 id=\"关键信号节点详解\">关键信号节点详解</h3><p><strong>机械转导（Mechanotransduction）</strong>：</p>\n<p>机械张力通过多条途径激活 mTORC1：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>磷脂酶D（PLD）产生磷脂酸（PA），直接结合并激活 mTOR</li>\n<li>FAK（焦点黏着激酶）通路</li>\n<li>离子通道机械敏感门控（如 TRPV4）</li>\n<li>细胞骨架张力传递（通过 costamere 结构）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>机械张力是肥大最主要的驱动力，即使在无生长因子和氨基酸的离体模型中，单纯的拉伸也能激活 mTORC1。</p>\n<p><strong>IGF-1/MGF 通路</strong>：</p>\n<p>运动诱导的机械生长因子（MGF，即 IGF-1Ec 剪接变体）以自分泌/旁分泌方式作用于肌纤维，通过 PI3K → Akt → TSC2 磷酸化解除对 mTORC1 的抑制。</p>\n<p><strong>氨基酸感应</strong>：</p>\n<p>亮氨酸（leucine）是最强效的 mTORC1 氨基酸激活剂。通过 Sestrin2 感应 → Rag GTPases → mTORC1 至溶酶体膜定位的通路发挥作用。训练后摄入含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\sim 3g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 亮氨酸的蛋白质可最大化 MPS 反应。</p>\n<h3 id=\"蛋白降解通路\">蛋白降解通路</h3><p>肌肉体积由蛋白合成和蛋白降解的净平衡决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>Muscle Mass</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>MPS</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>MPB</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\text{Muscle Mass} = \\int (\\text{MPS} - \\text{MPB}) \\, dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Muscle Mass</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPB</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>主要降解系统：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>泛素-蛋白酶体系统（UPS）</strong>：标记并降解短寿命蛋白和受损蛋白，E3连接酶 MuRF1 和 MAFbx/Atrogin-1 是肌萎缩标志物</li>\n<li><strong>自噬-溶酶体系统</strong>：降解细胞器和长寿命蛋白，适度自噬对肌肉质量维持必要</li>\n<li><strong>钙蛋白酶（Calpains）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ca^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 依赖性蛋白酶，参与肌原纤维重塑的初始步骤</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FoxO 转录因子同时激活 UPS 和自噬基因。Akt 磷酸化 FoxO 使其滞留胞浆，因此 mTORC1/Akt 通路同时促合成和抑分解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卫星细胞与肌核增殖\">卫星细胞与肌核增殖</h2><h3 id=\"卫星细胞生物学\">卫星细胞生物学</h3><p>肌卫星细胞（satellite cells）位于基底膜和肌膜之间的壁龛中，处于静息态（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 期）。它们是成年骨骼肌的干细胞储备，对肌肉修复和肥大至关重要。</p>\n<p><strong>激活与分化流程</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>标志物</th>\n<th>事件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静息态</td>\n<td>Pax7+/MyoD-</td>\n<td>静息于壁龛中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激活</td>\n<td>Pax7+/MyoD+</td>\n<td>损伤/机械信号触发离开静息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增殖</td>\n<td>Pax7+/MyoD+/Myf5+</td>\n<td>对称/不对称分裂扩增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分化</td>\n<td>Pax7-/MyoD+/Myogenin+</td>\n<td>退出细胞周期，融合准备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>融合</td>\n<td>Myogenin+/MRF4+</td>\n<td>与已有纤维融合或相互融合形成新纤维</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自我更新</td>\n<td>Pax7+/MyoD-</td>\n<td>部分细胞回归静息态维持干细胞池</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"肌核域理论\">肌核域理论</h3><p>每个肌核管辖一定体积的胞浆，称为<strong>肌核域（Myonuclear Domain）</strong>。域大小约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>2000</mn><mi>μ</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 2000 \\mu m^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，具有上限（&quot;ceiling theory&quot;）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>初始肥大阶段：现有肌核可通过增加转录活性支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 10\\% \\sim 20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span> 的肥大</li>\n<li>持续肥大：需要卫星细胞增殖并与纤维融合以增加肌核数量</li>\n<li>新增肌核具有&quot;记忆效应&quot;（muscle memory）：去训练后纤维萎缩但肌核不丢失，再训练时肥大速度更快</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"肌肉记忆的表观遗传基础\">肌肉记忆的表观遗传基础</h3><p>2018年以来的研究揭示了训练诱导的表观遗传修饰在肌肉记忆中的作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>训练使特定基因启动子区域发生低甲基化（hypomethylation）</li>\n<li>去训练后低甲基化状态部分保留</li>\n<li>再训练时这些基因更容易被重新激活</li>\n<li>增加的肌核数量在萎缩后保留数月甚至数年</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"影响肥大的训练变量\">影响肥大的训练变量</h2><h3 id=\"机械张力\">机械张力</h3><p>最关键的肥大驱动力。训练中的有效机械张力（Effective Mechanical Tension）取决于：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EMT</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EMT} = F_{active} \\times t_{tension}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EMT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li>高负荷训练（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>65</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;65\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65%</span></span></span></span></span> 1RM）直接产生高机械张力</li>\n<li>低负荷训练（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\% \\sim 50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span> 1RM）至力竭，通过疲劳募集高阈值运动单位实现高张力</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"代谢应激\">代谢应激</h3><p>代谢产物积聚（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、乳酸、ROS）可能通过以下途径促进肥大：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>增加运动单位募集（代偿疲劳纤维）</li>\n<li>提升全身合成激素环境</li>\n<li>细胞膨胀（Cell Swelling）信号</li>\n<li>ROS 作为信号分子激活 MAPK 通路</li>\n</ul>\n<p>但代谢应激的独立贡献仍有争议，机械张力仍被认为是主要驱动力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"肌肉损伤\">肌肉损伤</h3><p>离心负荷引起的微损伤可能通过以下途径促进适应：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>炎症反应释放细胞因子（IL-6、TNF-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>）激活卫星细胞</li>\n<li>损伤-修复循环促进结缔组织重塑</li>\n<li>肌节重排（串联肥大）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>但过度损伤是有害的，反复引发足够刺激而非最大损伤是训练优化的关键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"容量-强度-频率的优化\">容量-强度-频率的优化</h3><p>肥大训练处方的关键参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>推荐范围</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每组次数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6 \\sim 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 次</td>\n<td>接近力竭（RIR <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\sim 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周训练量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 \\sim 20+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 组/肌群</td>\n<td>个体差异大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\sim 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 次/周/肌群</td>\n<td>MPS 窗口约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>72</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24 \\sim 72h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负荷</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>85</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\% \\sim 85\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85%</span></span></span></span></span> 1RM</td>\n<td>均可诱导肥大（需达力竭）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间歇</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>180</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60 \\sim 180s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>短间歇增代谢应激，长间歇保容量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"年龄与肥大能力\">年龄与肥大能力</h2><h3 id=\"衰老性肌萎缩-sarcopenia\">衰老性肌萎缩（Sarcopenia）</h3><p>从约30岁开始，肌肉量以每十年 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\% \\sim 8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span> 的速度流失。关键机制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>运动神经元丢失和运动单位重组</li>\n<li>卫星细胞数量和功能下降</li>\n<li>合成代谢抵抗（Anabolic Resistance）：对氨基酸和机械刺激的 mTORC1 反应减弱</li>\n<li>慢性低度炎症（Inflammaging）增加分解代谢</li>\n<li>激素变化（睾酮、GH/IGF-1 下降）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"老年人的训练适应\">老年人的训练适应</h3><p>尽管老年人存在合成代谢抵抗，规律抗阻训练仍能有效诱导肥大：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>肥大幅度约为年轻人的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\% \\sim 75\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>需要更高的蛋白质摄入（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1.6</mn><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.2 \\sim 1.6 g/kg/d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>）和亮氨酸补充（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 3g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>/餐）</li>\n<li>更高的训练频率可能更有利（弥补单次 MPS 反应幅度的下降）</li>\n<li>力量增长的相对幅度与年轻人相当（主要来自神经适应）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"肥大的实践策略\">肥大的实践策略</h2><h3 id=\"渐进超负荷的实施\">渐进超负荷的实施</h3><p>长期肥大需要持续的渐进超负荷：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>增加负荷</strong>：每周尝试增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\% \\sim 5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>增加容量</strong>：每周增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\sim 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 组</li>\n<li><strong>增加训练密度</strong>：缩短间歇时间</li>\n<li><strong>增加动作范围</strong>：全幅度运动提供更多机械功</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"营养支持\">营养支持</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>每日蛋白需求</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1.6</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2.2</mn><mtext> g/kg体重</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{每日蛋白需求} = 1.6 \\sim 2.2 \\text{ g/kg体重}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每日蛋白需求</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> g/kg</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">体重</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li>训练后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\sim 4h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 内摄入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 \\sim 40g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 高质量蛋白</li>\n<li>每餐蛋白摄入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 0.4g/kg</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 以最大化 MPS</li>\n<li>轻度热量盈余（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+200 \\sim 500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> kcal/d）优化肥大环境</li>\n<li>睡眠前酪蛋白可维持夜间 MPS</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>肌肉肥大是机械张力经 mTORC1 信号轴驱动蛋白合成、并通过卫星细胞补充肌核来支撑持续生长的过程。肌原纤维肥大与肌浆肥大、并联与串联肥大分别对应力量与速度的不同适应方向；肌肉体积最终由 MPS 与 MPB 的净平衡决定，而 Akt-FoxO 轴使其在促合成的同时抑制降解。肌核域上限解释了为何长期肥大依赖卫星细胞融合，以及核数量保留带来的&quot;肌肉记忆&quot;。在训练变量中机械张力居主导地位，代谢应激与损伤为辅助刺激；无论年轻还是老年、增龄性肌萎缩或合成代谢抵抗，渐进超负荷与充足蛋白摄入都是维持与增长肌肉量的关键手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考资料\">参考资料</h2><ul>\n<li>Schoenfeld BJ. The mechanisms of muscle hypertrophy and their application to resistance training. Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research, 2010; 24(10):2857-2872.</li>\n<li>Wackerhage H, et al. Stimuli and sensors that initiate skeletal muscle hypertrophy following resistance exercise. J Appl Physiol, 2019; 126(1):30-43.</li>\n<li>Snijders T, Nederveen JP, McKay BR, et al. Satellite cells in human skeletal muscle plasticity. Front Physiol, 2015; 6:283.</li>\n<li>Morton RW, et al. A systematic review, meta-analysis and meta-regression of the effect of protein supplementation on resistance training-induced gains in muscle mass and strength. Br J Sports Med, 2018; 52(6):376-384.</li>\n<li>Seaborne RA, et al. Human Skeletal Muscle Possesses an Epigenetic Memory of Hypertrophy. Scientific Reports, 2018; 8:1898.</li>\n<li>Schoenfeld BJ, Ogborn D, Krieger JW. Dose-response relationship between weekly resistance training volume and increases in muscle mass. Med Sci Sports Exerc, 2017; 49(1):129-137.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"肌肉适应与肥大","id":"肌肉适应与肥大"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"肌肉肥大的类型","id":"肌肉肥大的类型"},{"level":3,"text":"肌原纤维肥大与肌浆肥大","id":"肌原纤维肥大与肌浆肥大"},{"level":3,"text":"串联肥大与并联肥大","id":"串联肥大与并联肥大"},{"level":2,"text":"肥大的信号转导通路","id":"肥大的信号转导通路"},{"level":3,"text":"mTOR通路——蛋白合成的核心调控枢纽","id":"mtor通路-蛋白合成的核心调控枢纽"},{"level":3,"text":"关键信号节点详解","id":"关键信号节点详解"},{"level":3,"text":"蛋白降解通路","id":"蛋白降解通路"},{"level":2,"text":"卫星细胞与肌核增殖","id":"卫星细胞与肌核增殖"},{"level":3,"text":"卫星细胞生物学","id":"卫星细胞生物学"},{"level":3,"text":"肌核域理论","id":"肌核域理论"},{"level":3,"text":"肌肉记忆的表观遗传基础","id":"肌肉记忆的表观遗传基础"},{"level":2,"text":"影响肥大的训练变量","id":"影响肥大的训练变量"},{"level":3,"text":"机械张力","id":"机械张力"},{"level":3,"text":"代谢应激","id":"代谢应激"},{"level":3,"text":"肌肉损伤","id":"肌肉损伤"},{"level":3,"text":"容量-强度-频率的优化","id":"容量-强度-频率的优化"},{"level":2,"text":"年龄与肥大能力","id":"年龄与肥大能力"},{"level":3,"text":"衰老性肌萎缩（Sarcopenia）","id":"衰老性肌萎缩-sarcopenia"},{"level":3,"text":"老年人的训练适应","id":"老年人的训练适应"},{"level":2,"text":"肥大的实践策略","id":"肥大的实践策略"},{"level":3,"text":"渐进超负荷的实施","id":"渐进超负荷的实施"},{"level":3,"text":"营养支持","id":"营养支持"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考资料","id":"参考资料"}],"prev":{"title":"肌肉收缩机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/muscle-physiology/muscle-contraction-mechanisms"},"next":{"title":"心输出量与运动应答","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/cardiovascular-respiratory/cardiac-output-and-exercise-response"}}